sequenceDiagram
    title Key Take/Return Workflow

    actor User
    participant PWA as PWA (Browser)
    participant ESP as ESP32
    participant Cloud as Firebase Realtime Database

    User->>PWA: Sign in with Google
    PWA->>PWA: Firebase Auth session

    User->>PWA: Tap "Unlock"
    PWA->>ESP: BLE: unlock command (0x01)
    ESP->>ESP: Activate relay (1.5s)
    ESP-->>PWA: BLE notify: door opened

    User->>ESP: Remove/Return key
    ESP->>ESP: Microswitch detects change
    ESP-->>PWA: BLE notify: key TAKEN/RETURNED

    alt Online
        PWA->>Cloud: push audit event
        Cloud->>Cloud: Store under /audit/{pushId}
    else Offline
        PWA->>PWA: Queue in localStorage
        Note over PWA,Cloud: Flushed when connectivity resumes
    end